       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INDEXDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 COLOR-TABLE.
          05 COLOR-ENTRY PIC X(8) OCCURS 4 TIMES INDEXED BY CX.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           SET CX TO 1
           MOVE "RED" TO COLOR-ENTRY(CX)
           SET CX UP BY 1
           MOVE "GREEN" TO COLOR-ENTRY(CX)
           SET CX UP BY 1
           MOVE "BLUE" TO COLOR-ENTRY(CX)
           SET CX UP BY 1
           MOVE "YELLOW" TO COLOR-ENTRY(CX)
           SET CX DOWN BY 2
           DISPLAY "ENTRY AT CX: " COLOR-ENTRY(CX)
           PERFORM VARYING CX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL CX > 4
               DISPLAY COLOR-ENTRY(CX)
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
